# The only Docker build in this repository is the sync server's
# (crates/smaragd-sync-server/Dockerfile), built with the repo root as context.
# Allow-list just what it needs so the context stays tiny and no local build
# output, VCS metadata or secrets can leak into the image.
*
!crates/smaragd-sync-protocol
!crates/smaragd-sync-server
**/target
**/.env
